  "description_text": "Exceptional Craftsmanship, Timeless Elegance & Modern Luxury Built in 2006, this beautifully designed residence showcases exceptional craftsmanship, sophisticated finishes, and thoughtful attention to detail throughout. Featuring custom millwork, distinctive windows, marble flooring, radiant heating, soaring ceilings, and an integrated speaker system, every element of this home reflects quality and refined design. The main level offers an elegant formal living room and dining room, complemented by a spacious eat-in kitchen featuring high-end appliances, a center island, and sliding glass doors leading to a beautifully appointed entertainer's backyard, creating a seamless transition between indoor and outdoor living. The second level features two generously sized bedrooms and a full bathroom, along with an impressive primary suite boasting vaulted ceilings, a spacious walk-in closet, and a private terrace adorned with custom railings. The luxurious primary bathroom offers a spa tub and a multi-jetted shower, creating a relaxing retreat. An additional third level provides expansive, versatile space ideal for a home office, recreation room, or storage. The high-ceilinged, fully accessible lower level offers an exceptional wellness and recreation space, currently equipped with workout equipment, a sauna, and a cold plunge soaking tub. This level also features a dedicated laundry area, abundant storage, an oversized walk-in closet, and direct access to the backyard. Designed for entertaining, the beautifully paved outdoor space features a built-in barbecue, pizza oven, planting beds, and a storage shed. A one-car garage with high ceilings and an expansive gated driveway provide added convenience and functionality. A truly distinctive residence where custom craftsmanship, luxurious amenities, and thoughtfully designed living spaces come together to create an exceptional place to call home.",
